  "ruleText": "Pod 401.01 Expiration of License. Licenses governed under this chapter shall be valid for 2 years from the date of issuance pursuant to RSA 310:8, II.\n\nSource. #5391, eff 5-8-92, EXPIRED: 5-8-98\n\nNew. #8061, eff 3-12-04; ss by #9901-A, eff 4-15-11, EXPIRED: 4-15-19\n\nNew. #12811, INTERIM, eff 6-14-19, EXPIRED: 12-11-19\n\nNew. #13819, eff 2-9-24; ss by #14457, eff 2-8-26, EXPIRES: 2-8-36",
